{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_014_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f7d940a9b9e44b89d16bf8a96e776114499460d0490bc231aeddba441421d089",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1ea4aeba5b9769b450da02abaa78a60577eabc8356609c33b0dbf482249c4c0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，巧克力谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd3c7d64814646b6eac1736dadfa735ff97361b780fdba8c153a6fd575c0a4e",
      "text": "我超级高兴的。因为你去年送的巧克力\n真的很美味啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33157cb218c89ae1ab63e6c2ba377e8f9056ee427f5b08ae83f8fb88273ef2d1",
      "text": "虽然嘴上没说，但我其实今年也一直很期待巧克力呢。\n在想你会挑什么样的送给我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26423393224b91dadc02fff293c22098b3d231f00232453e35151990bf1d282",
      "text": "我选了特别推荐的一款哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec35bc76a71e0ea086e48efda7946206b6c42729750af6a5f5d5acb72597d74",
      "text": "我选了英雄先生应该会喜欢的东西！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe87654510447154d3c18972310ac6fbbcc1db05955d3540694eecba9943659",
      "text": "哈哈，原来是用这种心思挑出来的啊。\n那今年的巧克力肯定也是非常美味无误了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94151a367c2240bffba4ec2b49c70b541b0b9286d65f8c39b5f4e1179ae2b5ac",
      "text": "从现在开始我就期待着吃了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40c15f4b070f0d452327218c34bd162d506931e1c6830a438eef3f917b642e3a",
      "text": "能听你这么说，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89e5b584a9e1fdbe074c7f7b5b867f5efcff642468d0f33942ded91945dcf4b2",
      "text": "嗯。这份高兴的心情，等白色情人节的时候\n我再好好回报给你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffbf8deef918b7a1b21f69a4da7bec2710b5cae16f9d4c462c3477f14c053207",
      "text": "我一定会找到能让你感到开心的回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_014_23:5_01_014_23_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c8ee0a1ec4ca14a5eb74ec34a4fbed88b19d46bd562642cd280167197652b81",
      "text": "会是什么样的回礼呢，你就满怀期待地等着吧。\n虽说不是要比赛，但我可不会输啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
